  "storage_and_io": {
    "trusted_facts": "The existing directory supplies accepted membership, canonical account/clan and room observations. Rust applies matching decisions; social/invitation/clan CRUD remains Python.",
    "transaction": "Generic apply executes Rust statements within the caller transaction and enforces Rust expected row counts. A real SQLite trigger failure rolls back both native and presentation consent.",
